    {
      "source": "Zips the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a>s using the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a>. The resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> will have the\nlength of the shorter of the two, abbreviating the zipping when the shorter of the two <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a>s is\nexhausted.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a> 压缩给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a>s。生成的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> 的长度将等于两个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a>s 中较短者的长度；当较短的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/stream/Stream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.stream\"><code>Stream</code></a> 耗尽时，压缩操作将提前结束。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
